 "remarks": "Classic charm, updated for today. This distinctive English cottage offers over 4,000 square feet of gracious living space, set on over one acre of expansive, level grounds on one of the largest lots on the street-in one of Darien's most sought-after locations. Inside, generously proportioned, light-filled rooms blend timeless architectural character with an easy, comfortable flow. Rich hardwood floors, arched doorways, custom millwork and two beautiful stone fireplaces add warmth and distinction throughout. The heart of the home is the bright, spacious kitchen with a large center island, opening to a charming breakfast room wrapped in windows. The sun-filled family room features a handsome coffered ceiling and walls of windows overlooking the property, while gracious living and dining rooms provide wonderful spaces for everyday living and entertaining. Flexible first-floor space is ideal for a home office, den or playroom. This 4 bedroom and 2.5 bath home is complemented by approximately 1,100 square feet in the finished lower level, ideal for a playroom, media room, gym or recreation area. Outside, expansive level grounds surrounded by mature trees create a picturesque setting with plenty of space for outdoor entertaining, recreation and play. Thoughtfully maintained and improved over the years, this special home combines classic character and craftsmanship with the comfort of today's lifestyle. Located in the Ox Ridge School District, close to train, town and shops.",
